WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.292 --> 00:00:01.001
♪♪

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:01.835
Paddle out again?

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:02.836
Race you to the next one.

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.838
♪♪

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:06.048
Woo!

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:08.091
♪♪

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:09.092
I love Surfside.

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:10.010
It's a little strange.

00:00:10.177 --> 00:00:10.969
My dad says you're

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:12.638
never too old to use
your imagination.

00:00:13.055 --> 00:00:14.139
You're also never too

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:15.349
young to
use your brain.

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:17.351
Look!

00:00:17.351 --> 00:00:18.852
This coin is AU-79.

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.187
Also known as gold!

00:00:20.604 --> 00:00:21.563
The cursed treasure!

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:22.397
I don't know about cursed

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:23.607
but this is
definitely treasure.

00:00:23.649 --> 00:00:25.275
♪♪

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:26.401
There's something going on

00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:27.361
in Surfside.

00:00:27.903 --> 00:00:29.655
But you might be able to 

00:00:29.655 --> 00:00:31.448
get to the bottom of it.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:32.115
Peligro.

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:33.116
What's that mean?

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:34.534
Danger.

00:00:34.952 --> 00:00:35.494
Uhh...

00:00:35.494 --> 00:00:36.453
Salutations

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:37.746
Are you an actual ghost?

00:00:37.746 --> 00:00:38.622
My mates call me Remy.

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:41.250
Is that...

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:42.876
Definitely not a buoy.

00:00:43.794 --> 00:00:45.170
So we got a pirate ghost...

00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:46.755
cursed treasure...

00:00:47.339 --> 00:00:48.799
and a booby trapped room.

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:50.259
That's not a sentence
you hear everyday.

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:51.593
If we don't solve
the mystery....

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:53.595
ancient evil
will be unleashed.

00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:56.014
Also a sentence you
don't hear everyday.

00:00:56.098 --> 00:00:59.059
♪♪

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:00.686
How does it all connect?

00:01:02.312 --> 00:01:03.272
It's a total mystery.

00:01:03.272 --> 00:01:04.273
No way.

00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:06.900
Jade has these new friends.

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:08.735
We're really different.

00:01:08.777 --> 00:01:10.696
But no one get's me
like Sam does.

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:13.490
You need to think
outside the box.

00:01:14.408 --> 00:01:15.909
And over time you'll come

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:16.910
to appreciate that.

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:18.662
It's good to be a
little strange.

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:19.663
I'm strange.

00:01:19.663 --> 00:01:20.914
Me too dude.

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:21.915
I'll say.

00:01:22.666 --> 00:01:25.669
♪♪

